{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25826","headline":"新楼诗二十首 城上蔷薇 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 城上蔷薇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔷薇繁艳满城阴，烂熳开红次第深。\n新蘂度香翻宿蝶，密房飘影戏晨禽。\n窦闺织妇慙诗句，南国佳人怨锦衾。\n风月寂寥思往事，暮春空赋白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}